---
import SectionHeading from '@/components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import { profile } from '@/data/profile';
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
  <SectionHeading title="About me" />
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-ink-muted">
    <p>{profile.positioning}</p>
    <p>
      I build projects because I enjoy it. I like taking an idea, figuring out how the pieces
      should fit together, and seeing it through until it is live. Mythos started as a tool I
      wanted for myself. Now it is a real site that other players can use.
    </p>
    <p>
      Right now I am reading Clean Architecture by Robert C. Martin. Outside of code, I enjoy {profile.interests.join(', ')}.
    </p>
  </div>
  <a href="/about" class="hover-link mt-6 inline-block font-medium text-ink">
    More about me
  </a>
</section>
